WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.410
The doors open at six.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.970
Work backward with me.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.390
Where do guests arrive?

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:05.710
Who checks the list?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.148
Can the caterer get through

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.430
while the crew is setting the stage?

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.030
Those decisions belong on the same plan.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.930
We build it around your venue,

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.670
your guests, and your budget.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.868
On the day, one producer connects

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.370
the check-in desk, the kitchen,

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.890
and the person calling the show.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.430
Tell us what you're planning.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.140
We'll walk the room with you.
